{'symbol': 'HLT', 'date': '2023-04-26 06:00:00', 'title': 'HILTON REPORTS FIRST QUARTER RESULTS; RAISES FULL YEAR OUTLOOK', 'text': 'MCLEAN, VA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HILTON WORLDWIDE HOLDINGS INC. ("HILTON" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: HLT) TODAY REPORTED ITS FIRST QUARTER 2023 RESULTS. HIGHLIGHTS INCLUDE: DILUTED EPS WAS $0.77 FOR THE FIRST QUARTER, AND DILUTED EPS, ADJUSTED FOR SPECIAL ITEMS, WAS $1.24 NET INCOME WAS $209 MILLION FOR THE FIRST QUARTER ADJUSTED EBITDA WAS $641 MILLION FOR THE FIRST QUARTER SYSTEM-WIDE COMPARABLE REVPAR INCREASED 30.0 PERCENT, ON A CURRENCY NEUTRAL BASIS, FOR THE FIRST QUARTER COMPARED TO THE SAME.'}